1
00:00:00,127 --> 00:00:02,087
(Leonard:)Thank you, Dr. Cooper.

2
00:00:02,254 --> 00:00:05,134
(Sheldon:)You're welcome, Dr. Hofstadter.

3
00:00:08,052 --> 00:00:11,142
Okay, I'm gonna go
get your discharge papers.

4
00:00:11,305 --> 00:00:13,185
[SHELDON CLICKS TONGUE]

5
00:00:13,682 --> 00:00:15,262
(Penny:)What?

6
00:00:15,434 --> 00:00:17,394
(Sheldon:)You seem like
a perfectly pleasant person.

7
00:00:17,561 --> 00:00:21,361
I can't understand why women
have such a hard time loving you.

8
00:00:27,863 --> 00:00:29,823
(Leonard:)Can you open this for me?

9
00:00:29,990 --> 00:00:32,620
- Can I see your stitches?
- Sure.

10
00:00:33,327 --> 00:00:34,867
[RETCHING]

11
00:00:38,040 --> 00:00:42,500
(Raj:)Answering the question once and for all
why Wolowitz bailed out of medical school.

12
00:00:43,337 --> 00:00:44,757
(Penny(entering):)Leonard, congratulations.

13
00:00:44,922 --> 00:00:47,552
- What for?
- Your Facebook status update.

14
00:00:47,716 --> 00:00:50,716
"Leonard Hofstadter is in a relationship."

15
00:00:50,886 --> 00:00:53,226
(Leonard:)What? No. No, that's not right.

16
00:00:53,681 --> 00:00:57,601
(Howard:)Oh, man, did you switch your status
before she did?

17
00:00:58,435 --> 00:01:02,235
(Howard:)Speaking as an expert,
way to look needy.

